{
  "schema": 1,
  "about": [
    "The test-audio starter set that tools/fetch_test_audio.py fetches into a local cache (TODO 14; the catalogue is",
    "doc/todo/14-test-audio-catalogue-2026-11-01.md). Kinds: 'zip' fetches members of a remote zip by HTTP Range, 'file' downloads",
    "whole files, 'freesound' picks up the owner's own downloads (<id>__*). Every file is pinned by size and SHA-256 (python -I",
    "tools/fetch_test_audio.py --pin fills in missing pins). Each output joins its inputs in order, each faded in and out over",
    "fade_ms and with gap_s of silence between them, optionally cut by start_s and length_s, and becomes wav48/<name>.wav, 48 kHz",
    "mono 16-bit. Tiers: 'permissive' has a licence that allows our use; 'unlicensed' has none, so it stays local."
  ],
